### listing all tasks

GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/?project=ecd81199-4403-4029-907b-a729648ad4ac



### create a task

POST  http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "assigned_project":5,
    "assigned_to":5,
    "title":"envirionment setup",
    "description":"set environment and collect all credentials",
    "priority":"Medium"

}
    


### retrieve a task (replace with a real task UUID)
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000/


### generate task using gemini ai
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/create-task-ai/a645e6f2-d391-4eda-a6df-7204a00d60ea/


### with pagination
GET http://127.0.0.1:8000/tasks/?page=1&project=a645e6f2-d391-4eda-a6df-7204a00d60ea


